From (1): n_c = 3 - n_e.
From (2): n_d = 3 - n_a.
From (3): n_f = 3 - n_b.
From (4): n_a + n_f = 3 => n_a + (3 - n_b) = 3 => n_a - n_b = 0 => n_a = n_b.
From (5): n_e + n_b = 3 => n_e + n_b = 3.
